  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Attempting to import the [\"Package Maker\" tool](https://vcc.docs.vrchat.com/guides/convert-unitypackage/) into a VPM project fails with the following errors:\n```\nPrecompiledAssemblyException: Multiple precompiled assemblies with the same name YamlDotNet.dll included or the current platform. Only one assembly with the same name is allowed per platform. Assembly paths: \nC:/Users/bd/unity-2/998sandbox/test-conflict/Packages/com.vrchat.core.vpm-resolver/Editor/Dependencies/YamlDotNet.dll\nC:/Users/bd/unity-2/998sandbox/test-conflict/Packages/com.vrchat.tools.package-maker/Editor/Dependencies/YamlDotNet.dll\n[...]\nSystem.TypeInitializationException: The type initializer for 'Unity.Burst.Editor.BurstReflection' threw an exception. ---> UnityEditor.Compilation.PrecompiledAssemblyException: Multiple precompiled assemblies with the same name Serilog.dll included or the current platform. Only one assembly with the same name is allowed per platform. Assembly paths: \nC:/Users/bd/unity-2/998sandbox/test-conflict/Packages/com.vrchat.core.vpm-resolver/Editor/Dependencies/Serilog.dll\nC:/Users/bd/unity-2/998sandbox/test-conflict/Packages/com.vrchat.tools.package-maker/Editor/Dependencies/Serilog.dll\n[...]\n```\n\nTested with:\n\n* Package Maker v0.1.0 (installed as local user package)\n* VRChat Package Resolver v0.1.8\n* SDK Base + Avatars 3.1.1\n* VCC 0.3.2",
